---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List and describe gRPC services, call methods and check health

Usage: rustman grpc [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List the services and methods of a target or a grpc request file
  describe  Describe a service, method or message, with a request template
  call      Call a method (a request file, or --target, --method and --data) and print the response
  health    Check a server's health with grpc.health.v1.Health/Check
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
  rustman grpc list grpc://localhost:50051
  rustman grpc list {{grpc_host}} --refresh
  rustman grpc describe grpc://localhost:50051 shop.v1.Catalog/ListProducts
  rustman grpc call grpc/get-product.rman.yaml
  rustman grpc call --target grpc://localhost:50051 --method shop.v1.Catalog/ListProducts --data '{}' --json
  rustman grpc health grpcs://api.example.com:443 --service shop.v1.Catalog
